<title>UK: MEPC up on renewed bid talk.</title>
<headline>MEPC up on renewed bid talk.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in property group MEPC Plc rose in pre-market trade on Monday after a weekend press report revived speculation of a bid from British Land Plc, dealers said.</p>
<p>MEPC shares were quoted up 9-1/2p at 507-1/2 by 0728 GMT in volume of 14,500 shares, while British Land was down 6p at 591-1/2.</p>
<p>A report in the Mail on Sunday renewed long standing talk of a bid, saying British Land was poised to launch a 2.2 billion stg bid for its rival.</p>
</text>
